[Configure GitOps with Flux](gitops-flux.html#application-config-in-flux).

## Step 5: Set up infrastructure

[Add infrastructure as code](infrastructure-as-code.html) where infrastructure is required.

## Step 6: Set up secrets management

[Set up secrets management](secrets-management.html).

